/**
 * SQUASH LEAGUE HQ: one-time setup
 * ---------------------------------
 * 1. Go to https://script.google.com → New project
 * 2. Delete what's there, paste this whole file in, click Save
 * 3. Pick "setup" in the function dropdown and click ▶ Run
 * 4. Approve the permissions (it's your own script; Google will warn you anyway)
 * 5. Open "Execution log": copy the SHEET ID and FORM LINK into the website's config.js
